WEBVTT

00:00.067 --> 00:03.901
Episode 12
Alternative

00:22.723 --> 00:23.781
Big Brother?

00:25.626 --> 00:26.490
Don't...

00:27.561 --> 00:29.324
Where are you, Big Brother?

00:33.567 --> 00:34.431
Don't go...

00:35.535 --> 00:37.162
You'll find out.

00:39.873 --> 00:41.431
That the time...

00:41.541 --> 00:44.135
The time of choosing has finally arrived.

00:46.079 --> 00:47.740
You'll find out.

01:10.304 --> 01:11.669
Blood...

01:11.772 --> 01:13.103
Lots of blood...

01:20.414 --> 01:21.711
It's all red...

01:21.815 --> 01:23.043
Mother's blood...

01:24.518 --> 01:25.450
Kotori...

01:25.552 --> 01:26.678
Don't!

01:26.787 --> 01:28.982
- Don't look.
- Mother...

01:29.089 --> 01:31.148
No, this isn't Mother!

01:31.258 --> 01:32.486
It's not Mother!

01:32.592 --> 01:33.559
- No!
- Kotori!

01:33.660 --> 01:34.524
No!

01:34.628 --> 01:35.652
No!

01:39.399 --> 01:41.629
Kotori, look this way.

01:41.735 --> 01:43.259
You can tell who I am, right?

01:43.370 --> 01:44.496
It's me, Kamui.

01:44.604 --> 01:46.094
Blood...

01:46.206 --> 01:47.605
Lots of blood...

01:47.708 --> 01:49.175
Look at me.

01:49.276 --> 01:51.107
Look at me, Kotori!

01:51.211 --> 01:52.542
Red blood...

01:52.646 --> 01:54.079
Look at me!

01:54.181 --> 01:55.876
Look at me, Kotori!

01:57.784 --> 01:59.843
M-Mother...

01:59.953 --> 02:01.181
Blood...

02:01.288 --> 02:03.756
The future is always one.

02:03.857 --> 02:05.882
There is only one.

02:05.992 --> 02:08.722
Nobody can change the future.

02:10.597 --> 02:11.825
It cannot be changed.

02:28.048 --> 02:29.037
Who?

02:29.149 --> 02:30.047
Who's there?

02:31.118 --> 02:34.610
I guess I didn't make it here in time.

02:38.091 --> 02:40.821
Don't come near us.

02:40.927 --> 02:43.623
If you come near us, I'll kill you.

02:43.730 --> 02:46.563
I am the chairman of CLAMP Campus.

02:46.666 --> 02:50.102
I came here after receiving notice from Ms. Tokiko Magami.

02:51.471 --> 02:55.134
To seal the Divine Sword until the Promised Day...

02:55.242 --> 02:57.642
...in the center of our pentagram.

02:59.246 --> 03:00.304
Kamui...

03:04.251 --> 03:07.220
Now, for her sake as well, we must hurry.

03:26.873 --> 03:27.737
Kamui...

03:28.875 --> 03:33.244
I shouldn't have returned to Tokyo, after all...

03:33.346 --> 03:36.315
I only bring tragedy around me.

03:36.416 --> 03:38.646
I only make the people around me unhappy.

03:38.752 --> 03:41.277
It's not your fault.

03:41.388 --> 03:42.616
Stop blaming yourself.

03:42.722 --> 03:45.350
Are you saying this is destiny, too?

03:45.459 --> 03:47.393
If I wasn't here...

03:47.494 --> 03:48.552
If I wasn't here...

03:49.663 --> 03:52.962
Kotori wouldn't have had to face all this...

03:53.066 --> 03:53.964
Damn it!

04:49.422 --> 04:51.049
Over here.

04:51.157 --> 04:52.055
Right here.

04:54.761 --> 04:55.819
Who are you?

04:56.930 --> 04:59.558
I am someone who crosses dreams.

04:59.666 --> 05:01.065
Crosses dreams?

05:02.168 --> 05:03.066
This is...

05:04.437 --> 05:06.371
This is inside your dream.

05:06.473 --> 05:09.874
And you will never awaken from this dream again.

05:10.977 --> 05:15.175
Because your heart has denied itself of waking ever again.

05:16.850 --> 05:19.785
You know of the future events that will occur,

05:19.886 --> 05:22.218
and thus took this course of action.

05:22.322 --> 05:23.880
Of your own will.

05:25.125 --> 05:28.253
You are qualified to be a dreamseer.

05:28.361 --> 05:29.953
Witnessing that tragedy

05:30.063 --> 05:33.123
that is the birth of the second Divine Sword...

05:33.233 --> 05:34.598
...you knew for sure.

05:35.702 --> 05:38.170
That the future is coming closer.

05:39.773 --> 05:42.833
I know, because I am a dreamseer like you.

05:42.943 --> 05:45.411
Dreamseer?
One who crosses dreams?

05:45.512 --> 05:46.410
That's right.

05:50.650 --> 05:52.982
I'm Kotori Monou.

05:53.086 --> 05:54.781
Who are you?

05:54.888 --> 05:56.549
Kakyou.

05:56.656 --> 05:57.748
Kakyou Kuzuki.

05:58.858 --> 06:00.723
You've been here all the while?

06:00.827 --> 06:01.885
Correct.

06:01.995 --> 06:04.361
I continue to sleep here for all time.

06:05.565 --> 06:08.227
Would you mind if I saw your face?

06:08.335 --> 06:09.597
That's fine.

06:09.703 --> 06:12.035
But not here.

06:12.138 --> 06:14.504
It would be all right in my dream.

06:25.118 --> 06:26.710
This is a wonderful place.

06:27.821 --> 06:29.015
Mr. Kakyou Kuzuki.

06:30.123 --> 06:31.249
Call me Kakyou.

06:32.959 --> 06:35.325
You're like me...

06:35.428 --> 06:39.023
Someone involved with the End of the World.

06:39.132 --> 06:42.659
We know about what will happen in the future.

06:43.770 --> 06:46.568
The futures of your beloved brother and Kamui.

06:47.741 --> 06:51.905
That is why you sacrificed yourself for their sakes.

06:52.012 --> 06:54.003
For the one and only hope.

06:56.049 --> 06:57.676
You know everything, don't you?

07:01.054 --> 07:03.215
Who did you do this for?

07:03.323 --> 07:04.449
No...

07:04.557 --> 07:07.685
There is no one in this world I would do this for.

07:07.794 --> 07:10.194
She no longer exists in any world.

07:10.296 --> 07:11.729
Nowhere.

07:12.832 --> 07:15.528
You were in love
with that person.

07:16.903 --> 07:18.803
I understand.

07:18.905 --> 07:22.033
Your sad feelings flow into me.

07:24.511 --> 07:26.138
You shouldn't.

07:26.246 --> 07:28.714
Don't get in synch with my heart.

07:28.815 --> 07:31.409
You'll die from the pain your heart will suffer.

07:32.485 --> 07:34.680
Now stop crying.

07:35.789 --> 07:37.086
Enough about me.

07:39.793 --> 07:41.021
Are you all right?

07:43.229 --> 07:45.925
I hope your wish comes true.

07:47.634 --> 07:49.158
Thank you, Kakyou.

07:53.073 --> 07:55.337
This really is a lovely place.

07:57.310 --> 08:00.677
In just a bit, Kamui's twin star will awaken.

08:01.848 --> 08:03.247
And at that time...

08:04.684 --> 08:05.742
This girl...

08:09.022 --> 08:11.217
It is coming closer.

08:11.324 --> 08:13.053
The time of choosing.

08:13.159 --> 08:17.357
It is approaching so close...

08:26.306 --> 08:31.005
Brain waves, blood pressure, pulse are all stable.

08:31.111 --> 08:34.410
But we should let her rest and see how she fares.

08:34.514 --> 08:39.542
However, for mental counseling, we need a long-term commitment.

08:39.652 --> 08:43.986
We will take responsibility and treat your sister.

08:44.090 --> 08:46.456
Please, don't worry.

08:53.266 --> 08:54.631
Kamui...

08:54.734 --> 08:58.363
I have something from Tokiko to show you.

08:59.639 --> 09:01.834
I want to stay here.

09:01.941 --> 09:03.272
I understand.

09:03.376 --> 09:05.936
Kamui, I'll watch over her.

09:06.045 --> 09:06.943
So go.

09:09.282 --> 09:12.479
The three of us will always be together from now on.

09:17.924 --> 09:20.984
This campus was created for the Promised Day.

09:22.095 --> 09:25.861
To protect the Divine Sword until the Promised Day.

09:25.965 --> 09:29.992
The Divine Sword is the only sword Kamui can wield.

09:30.103 --> 09:32.697
Then why are there two Divine Swords?

09:35.775 --> 09:38.903
The Divine Sword someone took from Togakushi Shrine.

09:39.012 --> 09:42.709
And this other Divine Sword that Tokiko gave birth to.

09:42.816 --> 09:45.114
If it's the only sword, why are there two?

09:45.218 --> 09:48.051
I don't know the answer to that, either.

09:48.154 --> 09:53.148
I was just told to protect the Divine Sword by Ms. Tokiko Magami.

09:57.297 --> 10:00.061
This is something she asked me to hold onto.

10:00.166 --> 10:04.296
She said the moment of her death would be when this doll broke.

10:04.404 --> 10:07.271
How did you know where the Divine Sword was?

10:07.373 --> 10:10.308
The doll showed me that, as well.

10:10.410 --> 10:13.106
This is in Togakushi Shrine's direction.

10:13.213 --> 10:16.649
Do you believe me at least a little bit now?

10:16.749 --> 10:19.741
Then I'll show you one more thing.

10:19.853 --> 10:22.515
This was also left by Tokiko to show you.

10:23.890 --> 10:25.255
Kamui...

10:25.358 --> 10:29.351
when you see this, I will have given birth to the Divine Sword,

10:29.462 --> 10:31.521
and will no longer be alive.

10:31.631 --> 10:35.499
That is why I will tell you something important here.

10:35.602 --> 10:38.230
Kamui, there is no time left.

10:38.338 --> 10:41.603
You must now choose your own destiny.

10:41.708 --> 10:44.734
To be a Dragon of Heaven, one of the Seven Seals,

10:44.844 --> 10:48.007
or to be a Dragon of Earth, one of the Seven Angels.

10:48.114 --> 10:52.483
The world's destiny will drastically change with that choice.

10:52.585 --> 10:56.214
To be a Dragon of Heaven and wish for the present.

10:56.322 --> 10:59.780
Or to be a Dragon of Earth and wish for a revolution.

11:01.628 --> 11:03.653
The present or a revolution...

11:04.764 --> 11:06.595
If you wish for the present,

11:06.699 --> 11:09.190
the future of this human-soiled Earth...

11:09.302 --> 11:12.169
...must be entrusted to the humans themselves.

11:12.272 --> 11:13.705
You must then wish...

11:13.806 --> 11:17.207
...for the aversion of the world's annihilation.

11:17.310 --> 11:18.777
If you wish for revolution,

11:18.878 --> 11:22.507
the world will be lost, and civilization destroyed,

11:22.615 --> 11:27.450
but the planet known as Earth will surely head towards a new rebirth.

11:27.553 --> 11:30.147
The present or a revolution.

11:30.256 --> 11:32.918
Kamui, you will choose the future.

11:34.027 --> 11:35.927
Your own future.

11:41.634 --> 11:44.432
Someone, stop Kamui...

11:44.537 --> 11:46.528
At this rate, that girl...

11:47.640 --> 11:48.607
Someone...

11:48.708 --> 11:51.302
Someone, stop Kamui!

11:56.482 --> 11:58.416
What in the world was that?

12:02.322 --> 12:04.722
Something must've happened to Kamui.

12:04.824 --> 12:07.156
Inside the pentagram.

12:07.260 --> 12:08.227
Pentagram?

12:08.328 --> 12:09.488
That school!

12:09.595 --> 12:13.122
To wish for the present or for a revolution.

12:13.232 --> 12:15.427
The time to choose is finally here.

12:16.536 --> 12:19.232
But there's only one future, Sister.

12:19.339 --> 12:21.569
You see the future in your dreams,

12:21.674 --> 12:24.905
but you can never touch that future.

12:25.011 --> 12:27.707
Even you cannot change the future.

12:35.054 --> 12:36.112
Destiny?

12:36.222 --> 12:38.122
What's destiny?

12:38.224 --> 12:40.818
A future that has already been decided.

12:40.927 --> 12:42.394
That's really strange!

12:42.495 --> 12:46.363
There's just no way the future can already be decided!

12:47.467 --> 12:48.934
That's true.

12:49.035 --> 12:52.232
Maybe you will be able to change the future.

12:54.507 --> 12:57.408
Because you are "Kamui."

12:58.611 --> 13:00.408
Become stronger, Kamui.

13:01.514 --> 13:04.381
So that you can protect Kotori and Fuma.

13:05.985 --> 13:08.920
So that you can protect your loved ones.

13:10.023 --> 13:12.423
To be a Dragon of Heaven and wish for the present.

13:12.525 --> 13:15.585
Or to be a Dragon of Earth and wish for a revolution.

13:15.695 --> 13:17.925
You will choose the future.

13:18.031 --> 13:20.124
Your own future.

13:21.701 --> 13:25.364
I don't know about what should happen to the world.

13:25.471 --> 13:30.272
It doesn't matter to me whether I'm a Dragon of Heaven or Earth.

13:30.376 --> 13:31.968
I just...

13:32.078 --> 13:33.773
I promised you back then...

13:34.914 --> 13:39.317
...that when something happens to you, I'll protect you.

13:40.920 --> 13:42.979
And that won't change, either.

13:43.089 --> 13:43.987
Ever.

13:44.090 --> 13:48.527
I heard it takes 10, even 20 years to get colors like that.

13:48.628 --> 13:50.528
But I think I want to try.

13:51.631 --> 13:52.825
That's my dream.

13:54.200 --> 13:56.964
10... even 20 years...

13:57.070 --> 13:57.934
Yes.

13:59.005 --> 14:03.408
I just want Kotori and Fuma to be happy.

14:03.509 --> 14:04.407
Kamui!

14:05.545 --> 14:09.072
I want to protect the place where they can live happily.

14:09.182 --> 14:10.877
That's all.

14:10.983 --> 14:12.041
Kamui...

14:21.394 --> 14:22.725
It seems you've chosen.

14:24.497 --> 14:26.795
The present over a revolution.

14:26.899 --> 14:27.866
Fuma...

14:27.967 --> 14:31.664
One of the Seven Seals, a Dragon of Heaven's future.

14:31.771 --> 14:33.238
You chose.

14:33.339 --> 14:34.863
What's wrong with you?

14:34.974 --> 14:37.704
If you become a Dragon of Heaven...

14:37.810 --> 14:40.802
...it is destiny I become one of Earth.

14:40.913 --> 14:43.473
What are you talking about, Fuma?

14:43.583 --> 14:45.050
Two Divine Swords...

14:45.151 --> 14:46.914
Two futures...

14:47.019 --> 14:49.487
I am your twin star.

14:49.589 --> 14:50.453
Fuma?

14:53.793 --> 14:56.921
I am the other "Kamui"!

15:23.856 --> 15:25.118
W-What's this?

15:35.067 --> 15:35.965
Fuma...

15:38.204 --> 15:39.102
Kotori...

15:43.843 --> 15:44.969
Kamui...

15:45.077 --> 15:47.307
I'm begging you, please be all right.

15:57.190 --> 15:58.623
K-Kotori!

16:04.263 --> 16:05.161
Kotori!

16:12.238 --> 16:14.468
Such a good voice, Kamui.

16:14.574 --> 16:15.541
Fuma...

16:15.641 --> 16:18.109
Do you know what you're doing right now?

16:18.211 --> 16:19.678
Of course.

16:19.779 --> 16:22.714
The Earth longs for a revolution.

16:22.815 --> 16:27.275
A revolution that humans will not get in the way of.

16:27.386 --> 16:32.449
I'll become a Dragon of Earth, kill all of the Dragons of Heaven,

16:32.558 --> 16:35.186
and wipe out all those who pollute the Earth.

16:35.294 --> 16:38.195
T-There's something wrong with you, Fuma...

16:40.299 --> 16:42.563
This is our destiny.

16:47.306 --> 16:48.637
Big Brother...

16:57.283 --> 16:59.342
Fuma!

17:09.161 --> 17:10.219
K-Kotori...

17:14.567 --> 17:15.761
You're next.

17:24.310 --> 17:25.971
Someone's inside the girl.

17:27.380 --> 17:28.438
Who is it?

17:32.485 --> 17:35.977
This girl does not wish for Kamui's death.

17:36.088 --> 17:37.385
A dreamseer...

17:38.824 --> 17:42.692
Moving that corpse by crossing into her death dream, are you?

17:42.795 --> 17:45.127
A dreamseer that controls the dead.

17:45.231 --> 17:47.825
Why do you get in my way?

17:47.933 --> 17:49.093
A Dragon of Earth?

17:49.201 --> 17:50.225
Answer me!

17:54.573 --> 17:55.505
Kamui.

17:55.608 --> 17:58.008
I will make sure to kill you!

18:13.626 --> 18:14.524
Kamui!

18:19.598 --> 18:20.895
Impossible...

18:21.000 --> 18:21.898
He...

18:44.824 --> 18:46.223
K-Kamui...

18:58.437 --> 19:00.530
Is this what you wanted?

19:01.741 --> 19:02.639
Yes.

19:05.945 --> 19:09.210
Because you had the potential to become a dreamseer...

19:09.315 --> 19:11.545
...I was able to cross into your dreams.

19:12.651 --> 19:15.814
We have dreams even at the moment of our death.

19:17.957 --> 19:20.391
I knew this would happen.

19:20.493 --> 19:21.391
But...

19:22.628 --> 19:26.086
...even if I know the future, I can't do anything.

19:26.198 --> 19:28.826
The person who was so dear to me... and you...

19:28.934 --> 19:31.664
I couldn't save either of you.

19:31.771 --> 19:32.760
But...

19:32.872 --> 19:34.339
...you saved Shirou.

19:35.441 --> 19:37.375
That's all I need.

19:37.476 --> 19:38.670
I also knew...

19:38.778 --> 19:40.837
...in my dreams that my brother and Shirou

19:40.946 --> 19:42.846
would be killing each other.

19:42.948 --> 19:45.109
But I couldn't do anything, either.

19:45.217 --> 19:49.711
What awaits Kamui is a sadness harder than death itself.

19:49.822 --> 19:51.551
The pain of losing you.

19:51.657 --> 19:54.091
Then fighting against and hurting...

19:54.193 --> 19:57.924
...the person he looked up to like an older brother.

19:58.030 --> 20:00.157
I believe in him.

20:00.266 --> 20:05.135
I believe that Shirou will not lose, no matter how hurt he gets.

20:05.237 --> 20:09.435
Besides, Shirou is the only one that can save my big brother.

20:11.677 --> 20:13.076
Thank you, Kakyou.

20:14.680 --> 20:16.079
I have to go now.

20:30.896 --> 20:32.329
Kakyou...

20:32.431 --> 20:35.525
If you see my big brother and Kamui, please tell them...

20:37.503 --> 20:39.368
...that I love both of them.

20:40.840 --> 20:41.738
And...

20:42.975 --> 20:45.409
...that the future still hasn't been determined.

20:48.247 --> 20:51.808
The future still hasn't been determined.
